I have an idea.

I don't know if it's a feature in 3.1.x, but why not make a new HARD option
that can be set from the config or options file?  From what I understand,
the HARD option must be set during the compile.  But if you can flag it from
your HACKOPTIONS file it would be easy for novices to set EASY and
veterens to set a VERYHARD opions, where Dragons and Balrogs are much much
tougher.  In fact, we could have a 4th option called "insane" where monster
toughness is tripled or quadrupled on the higher levels.  For the real
masochist.

